{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47526","headline":"七言 三十五 · 吕岩","name":"七言 三十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当年诗价满皇都，掉臂西归是丈夫。\n万顷白云独自有，一枝丹桂阿谁无。\n闲寻渭曲渔翁引，醉上莲峰道士扶。\n他日与君重际会，竹溪茅舍夜相呼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}